# @kintsugi/mend/sugar — the composition-shard body wiring the first
# self-applied kintsugi loop through apply_h::act dispatch. Composes
# over the four @kintsugi/fracture/* detection species + @magic/reveal/
# expand resolution species + Reed Fire A rust/-altitude primitives
# (phone::@io/fs.read_file + wire::parse for read; wire::emit +
# phone::@io/fs.write_file for write; apply_h::act shard-body-projector
# extension for dispatch — Fire E M-E2 shared primitive with Fire D M5
# wire-executor).
#
# Sub-species of @kintsugi/mend per Q4 Mara-lean concurred by Alex
# 2026-08-09 (composition-honest: sugar IS a mend variety filling the
# "crack" between store crystal and audience-source with the audience-
# relative projection-morphism; avoids over-elevating a composition-
# body altitude to sub-family-root).
#
# Reed Fire E tick M-E1 landing per Mara canonical spec §2.5 +
# forward-composed with Fire E M-E2/M-E3/M-E4 landings.
#
# === Substrate authority ===
#
# Alex 2026-08-09 verbatim (@kintsugi @magic composition split; sugar
# rule as first self-applied kintsugi loop). Alex 2026-08-05 memory
# `feedback-rust-delivers-primitives-substrate-delivers-composition`
# (composition-at-substrate discipline; wire protocols + rendering
# rules are shard-body compositions NOT rust/ modules). README central
# claim discharge: audience-relative rendering makes "written BY AI
# FOR AI and FOR HUMANS BY HUMANS" category-theoretically-exact via
# resugar∘sugar = id identity functor at content-address altitude
# (Mara math §2).
#
# === Composition-shard body pipeline ===
#
# Write-path (source → store):
#
#   phone::read_file(shard_path)                # @io/fs.read
#     |> wire::parse(_)                         # @data/mirror.parse
#     |> detect_all_fracturable(_)              # composition over 4
#                                                # @kintsugi/fracture/*.detect
#                                                # via apply_h::act dispatch
#     |> omit_fractures(_)                      # composition over 4
#                                                # @kintsugi/fracture/*.resolve
#                                                # via apply_h::act dispatch
#     |> @mirror/store.crystallize(_)           # store-side canonical form
#
# Read-path (store → audience-rendered source):
#
#   @mirror/store.load(oid)                     # crystal-OID lookup
#     |> @magic/reveal/expand.expand(_, aud)    # audience-relative
#                                                # projection via
#                                                # apply_h::act dispatch
#     |> wire::emit(_)                          # @data/mirror.emit
#     |> phone::write_file(_, shard_path)       # @io/fs.write (write-
#                                                # back to source when
#                                                # walker cascade fires)
#
# Round-trip fidelity check (Fire E M-E5 RED-first empirical test):
#
#   source_bytes_pre = phone::read_file(shard_path)
#     |> wire::parse(_)
#     |> @mirror/store.crystallize(_)              # oid_pre
#     |> @magic/reveal/expand.expand(_, human)     # full-form projection
#     |> wire::emit(_)                             # source_bytes_post
#     |> @mirror/store.crystallize(_)              # oid_post
#     |> assert(oid_pre == oid_post)               # bit-exact per Mara
#                                                    # math §2
#
# ASSERT contract: `resugar∘sugar = id` at content-address altitude
# per Mara math §2 formal proof (identity functor property). SEAM-2
# preserves indent-as-parameter (indent variation carried through
# round-trip as rendering parameter).
#
# === Cross-connect to Fire D M5 shared primitive ===
#
# apply_h::act shard-body-projector extension (Fire E M-E2 rust/-
# altitude) IS the shared primitive with Fire D M5 wire-executor.
# Fire E lands FIRST as low-risk pure-canonicalization validator;
# Fire D wire-executor lands SECOND sharing the validated primitive.
# Both compose over phone.rs + wire.rs + apply_h.rs Fire A primitives
# (88a2a19 + 74ee529 + f4dd4e3 landings 2026-08-06).
#
# === Ancestors ===
#
# Recognition #79 (5-op void-duality algebra); Recognition #80 (@magic
# as form/process substrate-decl); Recognition #81 (runtime-@magic;
# controlled disclosure); Mara 2026-08-09 physics insight (A_F
# universality); Reed 2026-08-09 Fire C tick 1 (cf8b21b shards/mcp/
# serve.mirror composition-shard precedent); Reed Fire A primitives
# (88a2a19 + 74ee529 + f4dd4e3); Taut 2b01da0 pattern-collapse-as-
# sugar scout; Mara 733cbf1 canonical spec + math; Seam 0a4c5a0 Phase
# D SEAM-RATIFY-WITH-SHARPENING.
#
# === Composition into existing substrate ===
#
# @kintsugi/mend            family-root parent; sugar IS a mend
#                            variety at rendering altitude.
# @kintsugi/fracture/*      four detection species Fire E M-E1 co-mints
#                            (prism_boilerplate + glass_boilerplate +
#                            out_derivable + path_namespace_stub).
# @magic/reveal/expand      resolution species Fire E M-E1 co-mint
#                            (audience-relative projection functor).
# @mirror/store             content-addressed store; crystallize +
#                            load actions carry the round-trip fidelity
#                            invariants.
# @apply_h                  bilateral-dispatch + shard-body-projector
#                            (Fire E M-E2 extension).
# @io/fs                    phone::read_file + phone::write_file
#                            primitives (Reed Fire A R-PRIM-2 lifted).
# @data/mirror              wire::parse + wire::emit primitives at
#                            @data/mirror altitude (Reed Fire A R-PRIM-1).
# @fractal/shard            typed-sheaf vessel; crystals landed at
#                            @mirror/store are @fractal/shard instances.
#
# === Substrate decisions ===
#
# [[architecture-shards-as-substrate-source]]
# [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]]
# [[architecture-alignment-as-boundary-mathematics]]
# [[feedback-rust-delivers-primitives-substrate-delivers-composition]]
#   — Alex 2026-08-05 HARD RULE; this composition-shard body IS the
#   substrate composition; rust/-altitude primitives compose here.
# [[feedback-substrate-already-had-the-word]] — @kintsugi/mend already
#   exists; this sub-species mint additively; no @kintsugi/sugar
#   sibling family (refused per Option D substrate-thin-species-per-
#   operation discipline).
# [[feedback-craft-not-deliver]] — mend body `\`-obligation-blocked;
#   Fire E M-E4 walker cascade + M-E5 RED-first test discharge at
#   realization boundary.
#
# Path-namespace property: this file at `shards/kintsugi/mend/sugar.
# mirror` declares `@kintsugi/mend/sugar` per
# `@epistemologic/pact/path_matches_namespace`.

source @arxiv/practice/wolf-2026-08-09-kintsugi-sugar-first-self-applied-loop
source @arxiv/practice/mara-2026-08-09-a-f-universality-sugar-mechanism
source @arxiv/practice/seam-2026-08-09-phase-d-kintsugi-sugar-cascade
source @arxiv/practice/taut-2026-08-09-pattern-collapse-as-sugar-scout

prism @kintsugi/mend/sugar {
  focus sugar_event
  project sugar_event
  split sugar_event
  shift sugar_event
  settle sugar_event
}

# === sugar_event carrier ===
#
# A typed record naming one complete sugar-cascade tick over a shard:
# detection + omission + round-trip verification + write-back (or
# skip if no fracturable pattern detected).
type sugar_event = {
  shard_path:      ref,
  oid_pre:         ref,
  oid_post:        ref,
  fractures_found: ref,
  bytes_removed:   ref,
  witness:         ref,
}

# === sugar_witnessing — composed bilateral predicate ===
#
# The load-bearing round-trip fidelity contract per Mara math §2.
# Passes iff oid_pre == oid_post bit-exactly. Discharges the identity-
# functor property empirically at every walker tick.
#
# Sentinel: `sugar-bit-parity-round-trip = pass-content-addressed`.
# Rice-safe bound: byte-equality check on two @mirror/store crystal
# OIDs; no semantics.
bilateral sugar_witnessing {
  sentinel "sugar-bit-parity-round-trip = pass-content-addressed"
  arity 1
}
sugar_witnessing(event: sugar_event) -> verdict { \ }

# === mend action — composition-shard body ===
#
# The composition-shard body per pipeline documented in header docblock.
# Composes over @kintsugi/fracture/*.detect + .resolve + @magic/reveal/
# expand.expand + @mirror/store.crystallize + Reed Fire A primitives
# via apply_h::act shard-body-projector dispatch (Fire E M-E2 extension).
#
# Per Q4 Mara-lean: mend IS the composition-shard body altitude for
# the sugar cascade; this action wires the full pipeline; consumers
# (Fire E M-E4 walker cascade) invoke via apply_h::act(root,
# "@kintsugi/mend/sugar.mend", shard_path).
#
# Body `\`-obligation-blocked at spec altitude; realization discharges
# at Fire E M-E2 apply_h::act extension landing + Fire E M-E3/M-E4/M-E5
# subsequent ticks. Requires round-trip fidelity discharge per
# `sugar_witnessing` bilateral.
mend(shard_path: ref) -> sugar_event
requires sugar_witnessing(_)
{ \ }

# === walk_cascade action — Fire E M-E4 walker driver ===
#
# Walks shards/ (or a subdirectory scope-restricted per --collapse
# flag), invokes `mend` per shard, commits per N-shards (or per
# recognition-batch), deposits pheromone-signature crystal at
# docs/bauchladen/ per @gift/lens.pay_forward discipline. Commit
# author: `mirror <mirror@spectral.engineer>` (first mass mirror-
# authored kintsugi cascade per Fire E M-E6 empirical target).
#
# Body discharges at Fire E M-E4 realization. Halt conditions per
# CURRENT.md Fire E halt-condition list (crystal-OID mismatch;
# substrate-truth grep-count deltas; new [ALEX-Q] surface).
walk_cascade(scope: ref) -> ref { \ }

out @kintsugi/mend/sugar
out sugar_event
out sugar_witnessing
out mend
out walk_cascade
